{
 "id": "social-ui",
 "title": "Social list UI kit",
 "category": "social-events",
 "summary": "Off-main-thread social lists: shaped text, CA rows, the recycling list, event page chrome, the social model.",
 "description": "SocialModel wraps the world + clock for the app (every query off the main thread); SocType shapes the row text with CoreText; SocRows / SocArt / SocList draw the 200-row lists as Core Animation layers; SocChrome and SocEventChrome hold the event pages' shared chrome (titles, info disc, warning card, stage strip, timer chip, reward icon, capture-ready markers); Countdown.swift the one event countdown formatter and its live ticking; SocScenario presets states for captures; SocialShells is the leaderboard / event page frame (the Leaderboard tab page, registered by SocialUIRegistration.swift). It reaches the events engine only through `SocialEventsEngine` (SocialModel.swift), which the engine registers. SocialLab is the debug host.",
 "status": "stable",
 "maxClosure": 20,
 "files": [
  "apps/mazeout/App/Shell/Social/SocialModel.swift",
